<title>USA: Allied Products buys more than 750,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Allied Products buys more than 750,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Products Corp said on Wednesday it has purchased more than 50 percent of the shares of the company's outstanding common stock that had been authorized under a buyback program.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of metal stamping presses and agricultural equipment said it has acquired more than 750,000 of the 1.5 million shares authorized for repurchase.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
